# Agon Wastes 06_sand_alamofront_dark layer 2: the disc's seven IngPuddles, all inactive at load.
# e082600c1/c2 (hp 5) and e08260040/44 (hp 10000) follow Patrol waypoints, e0826013f/140/142 have no
# path (Idle). Activate wakes them; a Deactivate on a puddle never activated takes the wasActive=0
# arm, Activate+Deactivate in one step the no-emitter arm. Deleting c2's first waypoint ends its
# patrol (Patrol -> Idle); `damage` (the player, not a weapon) takes HandleDamage's null-weapon
# return, a power shot the normal arm and kills c1 on patrol, a charged shot the heavy arm and
# kills c2 from Idle (Idle Deactivate -> Dead). `fsm` refuses: CIngPuddle is no CPatterned.
# For tools/cov/specs/ingpuddle.py.
@f300 layer 2
@f360 god 1; give missile 50; give chargeBeam 1
@f380 send e08260140 Deactivate
@f400 send e082600c1 Activate; send e082600c2 Activate; send e08260040 Activate; send e08260044 Activate; send e0826013f Activate; send e08260142 Activate
@f402 obj e082600be; send e082600be Delete; send e002600be Delete
@f420 tp 132 -88 54
@f440 send e08260140 Activate; send e08260140 Deactivate
@f700 obj e082600c1; obj e082600c2; obj e0826013f
@f900 shoot e08260040
@f960 shoot e08260040 missile
@f1020 shoot e08260040 charged
@f1060 obj e08260040
@f1100 damage e08260044 5
@f1400 send e0826013f Deactivate
@f1460 send e0826013f Activate
@f1600 obj e082600c1; obj e082600c2
@f1700 obj e082600c2
@f1800 damage e082600c2 1
@f1860 obj e082600c2
@f2200 shoot e082600c1
@f2260 obj e082600c1
@f2400 shoot e082600c2 charged
@f2460 obj e082600c2
@f2700 objs IngPuddle
@f2800 send e08260142 Delete
@f2900 objs IngPuddle
